      "message": "DX chip\u0027s flash size is different from the  CX,BX,AX\nChip Version is mapping from bit 3-0  , Flash size is mapping from bit 7-4\n0x00 is AX 128KB\n0x01 is BX 128KB\n0x02 is CX 128KB\n0x03 is DX 128KB\n\nCX before flash size (bit 7-4)\n0:128KB\n4:192KB\n8:256KB\n\nDX flash size(bit 7-4)\n0:128KB\n2:192KB\n4:256KB\n6:384KB\n8:512KB\n\n0x83 is DX 512KB (8 for 512KB , 3 for DX)\n\nI\u0027ll fix it later.",
